        "description": "Led end-to-end migration of a production survey platform from Java Spring Boot to Node.js (Fastify), reducing cold-start latency by ∼45% and cutting infrastructure costs by ∼30%. Provisioned Azure PostgreSQL Flexible Server via Terraform; owned CI/CD pipelines from build to production deployment. Redesigned data schemas with Prisma ORM and executed zero-downtime large-scale production data migration with automated validation and rollback safeguards. Integrated Kafka consumers to synchronize application and collaborator metadata with central systems, processing 10K+ events per day reliably. Built Temporal workflows for survey scoring (NPS, CSAT, SUS), notifications, and collaboration updates — replacing fragile cron jobs and reducing failure-related incidents by ∼70%. Implemented Redis caching layer supporting 1,000+ concurrent users with sub-50ms read latency, preventing DB saturation under peak load. Created a dedicated orchestration service running Temporal workers, enabling horizontal scaling of async workloads independently from the API layer. Set up Prometheus + Grafana dashboards tracking latency percentiles, error rates, and throughput; reduced mean time to detect (MTTD) issues by ∼50%.",
