      {
        "name": "Feature Suggestions Platform — Internal Product Feedback System",
        "description": "Designed and delivered a cross-team feature suggestion system serving multiple product teams, enabling structured product feedback at scale. Modeled hierarchical discussions using self-referential Prisma relations, supporting arbitrarily nested comments and replies with O(1) lookup per node. Implemented soft-delete strategies to preserve thread integrity and auditability across comment lifecycles. Built engagement features (likes, emoji reactions, voting) and email notification workflows for comments, replies, and feature status transitions. Designed a feature lifecycle integrated with Jira, enabling cross-team triage, scheduling, and release tracking from a single interface.",
        "role": null,
